(text "CM5. GPIO map: 0/1 ID_SD/SC -> header A I2C; 2/3 display I2C (DSI83 + touch); 4 TOUCH_INT_N; 5 TOUCH_RST_N; 6 DSI83_EN; 7 DSI83_IRQ;\n8-11 SPI0 to MCU (33R series); 12 BL_PWM; 13 BTN_BL_PWM (button backlight dimming, PWM0_CHAN1); 14/15 UART0 to MCU; 16 PANEL_VDD_EN (also touch power); 17 CM5_PWR_FAIL (in, hold-up active); 18-21 SPI1 header A;\n22 CM5_NRST (NPN o/c to MCU NRST); 23 SWCLK; 24 SWDIO; 25 MCU_IRQ; 26 CM5_HB heartbeat -> MCU PC2_C; 27 CM5_BOOT0 (1k -> BOOT0).\nCM5 5V from +5V_CM5 (TPS2121 mux: +5V / supercap hold-up boost). PMIC_Enable pulled low by MCU (via TCA9555 @0x25 P05 + NPN) = hard power-off." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 12 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "e5738041-cf83-41fd-8194-a28fda52ba01"))
)
